    "detailed_description": "The Puzzle Factory is a 6 in 1 puzzle game including Wordsearches, Crosswords, Maths Platformer, Chess, Solitaire, Mahjong, and more suprises!<br>Featuring relaxing music, engaging and problem solving gameplay and beautiful HD Full Motion Video elements and packing a huge amount of value.<br><br>No ads, no fuss, just one great game, accessible for all ages.<br><br>-Over 40 Crosswords to have fun and challenge your brain with!<br>-20 Picture Slide Puzzles with nice feelings!<br>-Over 10 Maths challenge modes featuring a cat with a jetpack just for extra enjoyment!<br><strong>-NEW! A beautiful 3D chess game with excellent AI, Spacefarer Chess is included!</strong><br><strong>-NEW! Addictive Solitaire with leaderboards!</strong><br><strong>NEW! Mahjong with different play styles and difficulty options with lovely graphics and relaxing sound.</strong>",
